cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use inkcheck / the Ink Recoverability Protocol, please cite it as below."
title: "vesuvius-inkcheck: the Ink Recoverability Protocol (IRP) for Herculaneum ink maps"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lescano
    given-names: Diego
version: 0.3.0
