license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dlescanogithub/vesuvius-inkcheck"
url: "https://dlescanogithub.github.io/vesuvius-inkcheck/"
abstract: >-
  CPU-only validation of Vesuvius Challenge ink-detection maps: registers a predicted ink map to a published reference
  of the same segment (possibly at a different resolution) and tests band-pass correlation, AUC and stroke recall
  against search-matched shift nulls, with negative controls, a saturation warning and a versioned per-segment
  report schema (ink card v1). Part of a pre-registered decision tree for deciding whether a segment's ink is
  missing or not yet recovered.
keywords:
  - Vesuvius Challenge
  - Herculaneum papyri
  - ink detection
  - validation
  - X-ray CT
